## SQ-CS-05 | off-season crops still grow (mid_winter, randomTickSpeed 100, 1 min)
> season set MID_WINTER
> fill 100 -61 12 112 -61 12 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock 100 -60 12 immersiveengineering:hemp
> setblock 102 -60 12 the_dirty_stuff:tobacco_seeds
> setblock 104 -61 12 minecraft:grass_block
> setblock 104 -60 12 vinery:red_grape_bush
> setblock 106 -61 12 nethersdelight:rich_soul_soil
> setblock 106 -60 12 nethersdelight:crimson_fungus_colony
> setblock 108 -61 12 minecraft:end_stone
> setblock 108 -60 12 endercrop:ender_crop
# fungus colony and Ender crop need low light (colony: raw light <= 12): a dark stone box over x 105..109
> fill 105 -61 11 109 -57 13 minecraft:stone hollow
> setblock 106 -61 12 nethersdelight:rich_soul_soil
> setblock 106 -60 12 nethersdelight:crimson_fungus_colony
> setblock 108 -61 12 minecraft:end_stone
> setblock 108 -60 12 endercrop:ender_crop
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 100
sleep 120
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 100 -60 12 immersiveengineering:hemp[growth=bottom0]
> execute if block 102 -60 12 the_dirty_stuff:tobacco_seeds[blockstate=0]
> execute if block 104 -60 12 vinery:red_grape_bush[age=0]
> execute if block 106 -60 12 nethersdelight:crimson_fungus_colony[age=0]
> execute if block 108 -60 12 endercrop:ender_crop[age=0]
reject (?i)exception
count Test failed >= 4
look every "Test failed" = grew past age 0; an "Unknown block" or property error = a guessed id (Ender crop id from endersdelight, CD endersAdditions); fix the id and rerun the row
> season set MID_SPRING
> fill 105 -61 11 109 -57 13 minecraft:air
> fill 100 -61 12 112 -61 12 minecraft:grass_block
> forceload remove all
